        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "12 months ago",
        "text": "Their trucks are not locked at 105 kmph. Report to opp if you see any . Highly untrained drivers who don’t know how to go uphill and downhill with other cars and trucks at 401 highway.\nI hope this company is not operating at highway 11/17.\nOne of their driver is definitely a safety hazard at 401 highway. I was in middle lane going uphill with fully loaded trailer and there was a car in extreme right lane going at same speed. We both were at 105kmph but slowly my truck slowed down\n\nThen exit 464 exit downhill came and he came behind me tailgating and started flashing lights on me. I couldn’t change lane as there was another truck in downhill right lane.\n\nBut this driver kept on tailgating and flashing me lights. Once I passed the trucki in right lane, I changed the lane and gave him way. But this driver whose speed was more than 110kmph showed me inappropriate gesture.\n\nIf I had applied brakes at downhill definitely something could have happened:\n\nSafety is compromised by this company. My review is legit and it’s not fake if said so by the owner of this company:, next time if I see your truck is not locked as per  Ontario law. I’ll report at 401 scale. Good luck\nDate 18 Feb 2024\nLocation 401 east\nTime 6:00 pm",
        "time": 1739924158,
